1
00:00:48,960 --> 00:00:49,760
Yun Qingqing.

2
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:52,160
You weren't home.

3
00:00:52,160 --> 00:00:52,920
You scared me.

4
00:00:52,920 --> 00:00:53,840
I saw you

5
00:00:53,840 --> 00:00:55,840
pacing back and forth
in front of our house from afar.

6
00:00:55,840 --> 00:00:57,080
What's up?

7
00:00:58,760 --> 00:01:00,120
There is something,

8
00:01:00,280 --> 00:01:01,480
but it's no big deal.

9
00:01:01,800 --> 00:01:03,000
Just tell me.

10
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:04,800
Why are you standing at the door?

11
00:01:05,800 --> 00:01:08,480
I have a little idea,

12
00:01:08,520 --> 00:01:10,960
but I don't know
how to discuss it with Mr. Shen.

13
00:01:10,960 --> 00:01:12,620
You're being so polite today.

14
00:01:17,360 --> 00:01:19,160
What's this? A proposal?

15
00:01:19,560 --> 00:01:21,600
I noticed the business at Yunbian

16
00:01:21,640 --> 00:01:23,000
hasn't been improving.

17
00:01:23,080 --> 00:01:26,039
So I wanted to discuss it with you

18
00:01:26,160 --> 00:01:28,520
and give some advice on its operation.

19
00:01:28,760 --> 00:01:30,840
Weren't you pretty chill about it before?

20
00:01:30,840 --> 00:01:31,680
Why the sudden urge

21
00:01:31,680 --> 00:01:33,080
to run Yunbian properly?

22
00:01:38,160 --> 00:01:40,479
Things aren't going well for Tang Jialing,

23
00:01:40,479 --> 00:01:41,880
and I can't help her much.

24
00:01:42,720 --> 00:01:45,840
So I thought I'd help her save this B&B.

25
00:01:46,280 --> 00:01:47,759
We can't just watch

26
00:01:47,759 --> 00:01:49,620
Yunbianshang go out of business.

27
00:01:51,120 --> 00:01:54,400
This is a promotion plan

28
00:01:54,400 --> 00:01:55,600
I made for a product
at my previous company.

29
00:01:55,600 --> 00:01:58,320
I stayed up all night yesterday

30
00:01:58,320 --> 00:01:59,960
to modify it for Yunbianshang.

31
00:01:59,960 --> 00:02:02,240
It might not be very mature,

32
00:02:02,320 --> 00:02:03,520
but take a look first.

33
00:02:03,640 --> 00:02:04,440
Okay.

34
00:02:14,360 --> 00:02:15,720
Is this what you've been working
overtime on for a week?

35
00:02:15,720 --> 00:02:16,780
The stuff you write

36
00:02:18,920 --> 00:02:20,800
is totally unrealistic and makes no sense.

37
00:02:20,800 --> 00:02:22,680
It's pure mental pollution.

38
00:02:22,840 --> 00:02:24,720
It doesn't fit the brand's tone at all.

39
00:02:24,720 --> 00:02:25,440
Redo it.

40
00:02:26,720 --> 00:02:27,920
What is this garbage?

41
00:02:28,120 --> 00:02:30,680
What do you do all day
besides pissing me off?

42
00:02:35,760 --> 00:02:37,079
This proposal...

43
00:02:37,120 --> 00:02:40,079
Is this proposal too bizarre?

44
00:02:40,079 --> 00:02:42,280
Too erratic, too unrealistic,

45
00:02:42,280 --> 00:02:43,340
and makes no sense?

46
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:45,360
I mean...

47
00:02:45,400 --> 00:02:47,840
It might not be very rigorous,

48
00:02:47,840 --> 00:02:50,440
but I just wrote it to give it a try.

49
00:02:50,440 --> 00:02:52,100
We can discuss a new proposal.

50
00:02:53,600 --> 00:02:55,000
I think it's pretty good.

51
00:02:55,000 --> 00:02:55,920
Very novel.

52
00:02:55,920 --> 00:02:57,050
It's eye-catching.

53
00:02:58,040 --> 00:02:59,640
You don't have to comfort me.

54
00:03:01,120 --> 00:03:02,440
My previous boss said

55
00:03:02,440 --> 00:03:03,240
this proposal

56
00:03:03,240 --> 00:03:05,440
isn't something a normal person
would come up with.

57
00:03:05,440 --> 00:03:06,440
What does he know?

58
00:03:06,440 --> 00:03:07,080
Think about it.

59
00:03:07,080 --> 00:03:09,360
People are already tired enough
from their normal daily lives.

60
00:03:09,360 --> 00:03:11,690
Occasionally, they just need to go crazy.

61
00:03:14,080 --> 00:03:16,200
What if it doesn't succeed?

62
00:03:16,200 --> 00:03:17,160
That's fine.

63
00:03:17,640 --> 00:03:19,000
I really like this proposal.

64
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:20,320
I believe you do too.

65
00:03:20,320 --> 00:03:21,720
And sometimes, people

66
00:03:21,720 --> 00:03:23,640
don't have to make the right choice.

67
00:03:23,640 --> 00:03:26,370
Occasionally,
you should make a choice you like.

68
00:03:28,680 --> 00:03:29,480
Right.

69
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:32,120
Yunbianshang hasn't had any guests lately.

70
00:03:32,120 --> 00:03:33,520
Even if it fails,

71
00:03:33,520 --> 00:03:35,000
it can't get any worse than it is now.

72
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:36,930
Let's just give it a desperate try.

73
00:03:37,920 --> 00:03:38,720
Maybe

74
00:03:39,280 --> 00:03:40,480
we can cooperate.

75
00:03:40,640 --> 00:03:42,880
Actually, I've always wanted
to promote our tea garden

76
00:03:42,880 --> 00:03:43,960
and tea brand.

77
00:03:44,480 --> 00:03:45,280
If

78
00:03:45,360 --> 00:03:46,880
we can collaborate with Yunbianshang,

79
00:03:46,880 --> 00:03:47,760
it might even achieve

80
00:03:47,760 --> 00:03:49,120
a synergy effect.

81
00:03:53,480 --> 00:03:54,200
Let's do it.

82
00:03:54,400 --> 00:03:56,440
Let's go back
and have a meeting right now.

83
00:03:56,440 --> 00:03:57,920
If we work hard,

84
00:03:57,960 --> 00:03:59,440
Tangtang will drive
a Land Rover next year.

85
00:03:59,440 --> 00:04:00,280
No rush.

86
00:04:00,360 --> 00:04:01,840
It's already mealtime.

87
00:04:01,880 --> 00:04:03,410
Why not leave after eating?

88
00:04:03,720 --> 00:04:05,440
I'd feel bad about that.

89
00:04:05,440 --> 00:04:08,500
Mr. Shen, you're giving ideas
and treating me to a meal.

90
00:04:08,600 --> 00:04:10,130
So what are we eating today?

91
00:04:17,600 --> 00:04:18,360
Jia,

92
00:04:18,399 --> 00:04:19,440
the videos from our Nordic trip

93
00:04:19,440 --> 00:04:21,040
are doing great.

94
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:23,080
A lot of brands have already
reached out to us.

95
00:04:23,080 --> 00:04:23,840
By the way,

96
00:04:24,240 --> 00:04:26,920
have we finalized the topic
for our next video?

97
00:04:27,600 --> 00:04:28,840
I've picked a few.

98
00:04:29,120 --> 00:04:31,780
Just waiting for you to review
and make the call.

99
00:04:35,040 --> 00:04:35,900
Hey, gorgeous.

100
00:04:38,440 --> 00:04:40,240
Gorgeous, want to buy some tea?

101
00:04:40,840 --> 00:04:41,760
Where is the tea from?

102
00:04:41,760 --> 00:04:43,159
Xinchang Dafo Longjing.

103
00:04:43,440 --> 00:04:45,280
It smells amazing
and has a sweet aftertaste.

104
00:04:45,280 --> 00:04:46,140
You'll love it.

105
00:04:46,440 --> 00:04:47,200
Let me see.

106
00:04:47,400 --> 00:04:48,720
This is Shen Feng. You go first.

107
00:04:48,720 --> 00:04:49,920
Are you buying or not?

108
00:04:50,560 --> 00:04:52,290
I just want to take a look first.

109
00:04:52,960 --> 00:04:54,520
If you're not buying, give it back.

110
00:04:54,520 --> 00:04:57,380
How do I know if I want to buy it
without looking at it?

111
00:04:59,440 --> 00:05:01,600
Give it back if you're not buying.

112
00:05:06,440 --> 00:05:08,170
That's enough, that's enough.

113
00:05:11,640 --> 00:05:13,280
Escape to Yunbianshang.

114
00:05:15,840 --> 00:05:18,440
Hey, want to come to Yunbianshang
for some tea?

115
00:05:18,720 --> 00:05:20,280
The sweet and fragrant kind.

116
00:05:20,280 --> 00:05:21,200
Drink it standing,

117
00:05:21,200 --> 00:05:22,200
sitting,

118
00:05:22,320 --> 00:05:23,400
or lying down.

119
00:05:24,160 --> 00:05:26,240
Bring your husband and kids

120
00:05:26,240 --> 00:05:28,240
to Yunbianshang for some tea!

121
00:05:28,520 --> 00:05:30,040
Huohuo, look here.

122
00:05:30,080 --> 00:05:30,880
One more.

123
00:05:32,080 --> 00:05:33,440
Bring your husband and kids

124
00:05:33,440 --> 00:05:35,100
to Yunbianshang for some tea!

125
00:06:20,240 --> 00:06:22,680
What got into Shen Feng recently?

126
00:06:23,080 --> 00:06:25,740
He's actually making
abstract meme videos now.

127
00:06:29,440 --> 00:06:30,560
Haven't seen him in so long.

128
00:06:30,560 --> 00:06:32,440
The once aloof heartthrob

129
00:06:32,440 --> 00:06:34,840
has transformed into an abstract vlogger.

130
00:06:36,800 --> 00:06:38,360
We are recruiting travel testers

131
00:06:38,360 --> 00:06:39,890
for a free trip to Xinchang.

132
00:06:45,000 --> 00:06:46,040
Fill out the questionnaire,

133
00:06:46,040 --> 00:06:47,120
and we will provide you with

134
00:06:47,120 --> 00:06:48,980
specially customized services.

135
00:06:49,440 --> 00:06:50,840
It's so detailed.

136
00:06:51,040 --> 00:06:53,170
I even have to take a personality test.

137
00:06:55,640 --> 00:06:57,440
The topic for our next travel video
is set.

138
00:06:57,440 --> 00:06:58,760
Where are we going then, Jia?

139
00:06:58,760 --> 00:07:00,160
We're going to Xinchang.

140
00:07:00,240 --> 00:07:03,040
To Yunbianshang.

141
00:07:12,200 --> 00:07:13,440
I've carefully studied

142
00:07:13,440 --> 00:07:14,640
this guest's questionnaire.

143
00:07:14,640 --> 00:07:16,160
She's an extrovert among extroverts.

144
00:07:16,160 --> 00:07:18,200
She likes lively vibes
and a sense of ceremony.

145
00:07:18,200 --> 00:07:19,520
We really need to show her what we've got.

146
00:07:19,520 --> 00:07:20,000
In a bit,

147
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:21,680
just unleash that move I taught you

148
00:07:21,680 --> 00:07:24,360
to the fullest.

149
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:28,520
Do we really have to go that far?

150
00:07:28,520 --> 00:07:29,280
Of course.

151
00:07:29,680 --> 00:07:31,360
She's our very first trial guest.

152
00:07:31,360 --> 00:07:32,200
Only if she says it's good

153
00:07:32,200 --> 00:07:33,360
can our event continue.

154
00:07:33,360 --> 00:07:33,960
Right?

155
00:07:36,320 --> 00:07:37,480
She's an extrovert,

156
00:07:37,600 --> 00:07:38,640
but I'm an introvert.

157
00:07:38,640 --> 00:07:39,840
I'm an introvert too.

158
00:07:41,320 --> 00:07:42,320
As everyone knows,

159
00:07:42,320 --> 00:07:44,650
introverts are just toys for extroverts.

160
00:07:44,840 --> 00:07:45,520
Come on, like this.

161
00:07:45,520 --> 00:07:46,280
Listen to me.

162
00:07:46,440 --> 00:07:48,400
First, just relax your mind.

163
00:07:48,480 --> 00:07:48,800
Relax.

164
00:07:48,800 --> 00:07:49,840
Close your eyes,

165
00:07:50,159 --> 00:07:51,090
brace yourself,

166
00:07:51,280 --> 00:07:52,340
take a deep breath,

167
00:07:53,600 --> 00:07:55,920
and you can do anything.

168
00:07:58,080 --> 00:07:58,480
She's here.

169
00:07:58,480 --> 00:07:59,540
And she's a beauty.

170
00:08:02,560 --> 00:08:03,280
Go get 'em.

171
00:08:03,640 --> 00:08:05,320
I'll give you a raise later.

172
00:08:05,520 --> 00:08:06,480
Go.

173
00:08:09,640 --> 00:08:11,840
Excuse me, are you Ms. Ajia,

174
00:08:12,080 --> 00:08:13,040
the guest from Yunbian?

175
00:08:13,040 --> 00:08:14,170
That's me. Let's go.

176
00:08:15,400 --> 00:08:19,640
Ms. Ajia, I'm here to pick you up.

177
00:08:21,480 --> 00:08:22,940
Beautiful, so beautiful.

178
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:24,680
You're so beautiful, Ms. Ajia.

179
00:08:24,680 --> 00:08:26,040
Wow,

180
00:08:26,200 --> 00:08:27,760
Ms. Ajia, you look amazing.

181
00:08:27,760 --> 00:08:29,080
So fair and pretty.

182
00:08:34,440 --> 00:08:36,679
You guys really know how to put on a show.

183
00:08:36,679 --> 00:08:38,480
A talent show before getting in?

184
00:08:40,720 --> 00:08:42,960
A warm welcome to the first guest
of Yunbianshang.

185
00:08:42,960 --> 00:08:44,880
Your happy retirement is about to begin.

186
00:08:44,880 --> 00:08:46,000
Yunbianshang will surely give you

187
00:08:46,000 --> 00:08:47,520
a perfect and unforgettable vacation.

188
00:08:47,520 --> 00:08:49,400
Hop in.

189
00:08:54,800 --> 00:08:55,960
Let me help you.

190
00:09:01,920 --> 00:09:02,480
Let me do it.

191
00:09:02,480 --> 00:09:03,540
It's okay. I got it.

192
00:09:07,080 --> 00:09:08,610
Here, let me give you a hand.

193
00:09:12,520 --> 00:09:13,240
Oh, right.

194
00:09:14,160 --> 00:09:16,240
Three, two, one, let's go!

195
00:09:23,360 --> 00:09:24,040
Let's go!

196
00:09:24,320 --> 00:09:26,160
Drive slowly. Hold on tight.

197
00:09:29,960 --> 00:09:30,520
Look.

198
00:09:32,800 --> 00:09:34,200
I've been to many places

199
00:09:34,200 --> 00:09:36,400
and stayed in quite a few hotels and B&Bs.

200
00:09:36,400 --> 00:09:37,760
I honestly think

201
00:09:37,760 --> 00:09:39,560
this B&B is very well managed.

202
00:09:39,600 --> 00:09:42,240
The rooms are clean and tidy,

203
00:09:42,280 --> 00:09:44,920
and all the amenities are
brand new and name-brand.

204
00:09:44,920 --> 00:09:48,360
You can see the tea mountains and
the sea of clouds right from the window.

205
00:09:48,360 --> 00:09:49,480
And the room fragrance.

206
00:09:49,480 --> 00:09:51,640
I smelled it,
and it's very nice and unique.

207
00:09:51,640 --> 00:09:53,760
That's the signature fragrance
of our Yunbianshang.

208
00:09:53,760 --> 00:09:54,360
We specially hired

209
00:09:54,360 --> 00:09:56,160
an international fragrance master
to create it.

210
00:09:56,160 --> 00:09:57,920
It contains lavender

211
00:09:57,920 --> 00:09:59,000
and valerian.

212
00:09:59,000 --> 00:09:59,640
It not only smells good

213
00:09:59,640 --> 00:10:01,040
but also helps you sleep.

214
00:10:01,520 --> 00:10:01,920
By the way.

215
00:10:01,920 --> 00:10:03,840
Our B&B doesn't just offer
a comfortable sleep.

216
00:10:03,840 --> 00:10:05,800
There's also a professional
tea-picking activity later.

217
00:10:05,800 --> 00:10:06,760
When you pick tea,

218
00:10:06,760 --> 00:10:08,160
a professional tea master

219
00:10:08,160 --> 00:10:09,320
will guide you one-on-one.

220
00:10:09,320 --> 00:10:11,120
The tea leaves you pick yourself

221
00:10:11,200 --> 00:10:12,720
will be roasted for you

222
00:10:12,720 --> 00:10:14,240
to take home as a souvenir.

223
00:10:14,320 --> 00:10:17,080
Our tea master is him.

224
00:10:18,400 --> 00:10:19,200
Shen Feng.

225
00:10:20,320 --> 00:10:21,040
Shen Feng.

226
00:10:23,760 --> 00:10:24,440
A Jia.

227
00:10:28,240 --> 00:10:29,440
Slow down, slow down.

228
00:10:31,640 --> 00:10:33,760
Shen Feng, what are you wearing?

229
00:10:33,760 --> 00:10:35,280
You look exactly like an old tea farmer.

230
00:10:35,280 --> 00:10:36,840
I am a tea farmer.

231
00:10:36,840 --> 00:10:37,770
Didn't you know?

232
00:10:38,960 --> 00:10:40,120
Someone

233
00:10:40,120 --> 00:10:41,520
never contacts me

234
00:10:41,640 --> 00:10:43,240
unless he needs something.

235
00:10:43,440 --> 00:10:45,320
You've been drinking my tea for years.

236
00:10:45,320 --> 00:10:46,560
It's time to pay off your debt.

237
00:10:46,560 --> 00:10:47,360
Shen Feng,

238
00:10:48,320 --> 00:10:50,200
so you know this pretty lady.

239
00:10:50,440 --> 00:10:51,680
She's not a lady,

240
00:10:51,800 --> 00:10:53,130
she's a younger sister.

241
00:10:53,760 --> 00:10:54,520
What do you know?

242
00:10:54,520 --> 00:10:56,380
"Lady" is a term of respect, okay?

243
00:10:57,400 --> 00:10:58,800
Our activity just started,

244
00:10:58,800 --> 00:11:01,080
so we need some popular bloggers
to bring in some heat.

245
00:11:01,080 --> 00:11:01,840
And A Jia here

246
00:11:01,840 --> 00:11:03,360
is a famous travel blogger.

247
00:11:03,360 --> 00:11:04,600
Even though we're friends,

248
00:11:04,600 --> 00:11:05,880
please don't hold back.

249
00:11:05,880 --> 00:11:07,800
Tell us anytime
if there's anything lacking.

250
00:11:07,800 --> 00:11:09,040
Experience it with your heart

251
00:11:09,040 --> 00:11:10,370
and report truthfully.

252
00:11:10,880 --> 00:11:13,080
Shen Feng, you have great connections.

253
00:11:13,080 --> 00:11:14,800
Last time we shot the promo,

254
00:11:14,800 --> 00:11:15,360
you even convinced

255
00:11:15,360 --> 00:11:16,920
the local leaders to dance with us.

256
00:11:16,920 --> 00:11:19,720
And now you've invited
such a great blogger.

257
00:11:20,120 --> 00:11:21,760
If someone else asked me,

258
00:11:21,800 --> 00:11:23,960
I might have to negotiate the price.

259
00:11:23,960 --> 00:11:26,280
But for him, I wouldn't hesitate.

260
00:11:28,520 --> 00:11:30,040
This tea garden is really beautiful.

261
00:11:30,040 --> 00:11:30,640
Qingqing,

262
00:11:30,640 --> 00:11:32,200
could you help me shoot some videos?

263
00:11:32,200 --> 00:11:33,120
Don't worry too much
about the camera work.

264
00:11:33,120 --> 00:11:34,760
I can edit it myself when I get back.

265
00:11:34,760 --> 00:11:35,520
Sure.

266
00:11:36,960 --> 00:11:37,760
I'll shoot it for you.

267
00:11:37,760 --> 00:11:39,200
She has other things to do this afternoon.

268
00:11:39,200 --> 00:11:41,200
Are your skills up to it?

269
00:11:41,240 --> 00:11:42,720
If you make me look ugly,

270
00:11:42,720 --> 00:11:44,200
I'll write it in the review.

271
00:11:44,200 --> 00:11:45,720
I have nothing to do all afternoon.

272
00:11:45,720 --> 00:11:48,040
I'll definitely shoot
until you're satisfied.

273
00:11:48,040 --> 00:11:49,000
We'll go first.

274
00:11:49,200 --> 00:11:49,880
Come on.

275
00:11:52,880 --> 00:11:54,400
Right.

276
00:11:57,480 --> 00:11:59,400
They seem pretty close.

277
00:12:02,040 --> 00:12:03,040
Want some tea?

278
00:12:05,200 --> 00:12:05,880
Sure.

279
00:12:06,000 --> 00:12:06,600
Here.

280
00:12:07,280 --> 00:12:09,320
Shurong, I really have
to thank you this time.

281
00:12:09,320 --> 00:12:10,120
Thanks to you,

282
