298
00:12:41,960 --> 00:12:44,840
I just thought our promotion was working.

299
00:12:45,320 --> 00:12:46,400
Here, here.

300
00:12:46,400 --> 00:12:47,800
I get it.

301
00:12:48,480 --> 00:12:50,480
Beautiful, beautiful, beautiful.

302
00:12:51,760 --> 00:12:52,720
One more, one more. Come on.

303
00:12:52,720 --> 00:12:53,760
I just didn't expect

304
